OL,3,GNEWSAPain cafes face closure without
OL,4,Afurther funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA support network helping people live
OL,7,Fwith chronic pain in Cornwall and Devon
OL,8,Fcould be forced to close unless funding
OL,9,Fis secured by April, its founder has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FChronic pain coach Julie Widdecombe set
OL,13,Fup the pain cafes in 2023 in Plymouth,
OL,14,FDevon, to bring together people living
OL,15,Fwith long-term pain, helping them share
OL,16,Fexperiences and learn practical ways to
OL,17,Fmanage their condition.
OL,19,FThe National Lottery provided initial
OL,20,Ffunding; there was later a Devon
OL,21,FCommunity Foundation grant and
OL,22,Ffundraising events have been held.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
