OL,3,GNEWSAPain cafes face closure without
OL,4,Afurther funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile demand has grown, finding ongoing
OL,7,Ffunding has proved challenging and
OL,8,FWiddecombe said: "We help so many
OL,9,Fpeople and I don't want to turn my back
OL,10,Fon them."
